<li id="mwA74">Blumer, H. &amp; Morrione, T. J. 2004. <i id="mwA78">George Herbert Mead and Human Conduct</i>. New York: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AltaMira_Press" title="AltaMira Press" class="mw-redirect" id="mwA8A">Altamira Press</a>.</li>
