<li id="mwA-U"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jürgen_Habermas" title="Jürgen Habermas" id="mwA-Y">Habermas, Jürgen</a>. 1992. "Individuation through socialization: On George Herbert Mead's theory of socialization." in <i id="mwA-c">Postmetaphysical Thinking</i>, by J. Habermas, translated by W. M. Hohengarten. Cambridge, MA: MIT Press.</li>
