<li id="mwA-4">Lundgren, D. C. 2004. "Social feedback and self-appraisals: Current status of the Mead-Cooley hypothesis." <i id="mwA-8"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Symbolic_Interaction_(journal)" title="Symbolic Interaction (journal)" id="mwA_A">Symbolic Interaction</a></i> 27:267–86.</li>
